<title>USA: Mattel raises qtly payout to $0.07/shr.</title>
<headline>Mattel raises qtly payout to $0.07/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mattel Inc Wedsnesday said the company's board of directors increased the quarterly dividend 17 percent to $0.07 a share from $0.06 a share, payable July 3, to shareholders of record on June 16.</p>
</text>
